meta {
  name: 03_AuthorizedPartiesLookup
  seq: 3
}

docs {
  Scenario: A service owner looks up the parties a person can act on behalf of

    When the service owner looks up a person's authorized parties filtered to the person
    Then the person's own party is returned with its roles
    When the service owner filters on an org code it does not own the request fails
    When the token lacks the authorized parties scope the request is forbidden

  Read only; the scenario needs no reset or cleanup.
}
